        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-01-14T16:15:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Technically it came up in a game about a week ago, when I think we were against Akash'Bhuta, or possibly Spite. Anyway, whomever it was attempted to force a discard and we had a Police card out...but I totally forgot about the \"destroy the Police instead\" bit (as it had never come up before) so we just discarded as per the villain's card. I think the Police later got destroyed anyway when Rooftop Combat came out.</p>",
